          "_label": "Details (Official List Description)"
        }
      ],
      "content": "SP 80 NW               ELLESBOROUGH                CHALKSHIRE ROAD 2/5                                                Dunrobin House - -                                                  II House.  Circa 1800 with early-mid C19 extensions to right and rear. 2 original bays are of red and vitreous header brick with red brick quoins and dentil eaves.  Old tile roof.  External brick chimney to left with dentil head, part rendered; smaller chimney to right. 2 storeys.  3-light leaded casements to first floor and to ground floor left, the latter with segmental head.  2-light casement to centre of ground floor, probably in blocked doorway.  Half-glazed door to right in altered opening with C20 gabled porch.  Early C19 bay to right, of red brick with off-set eaves and 2 storeys of 3-light leaded casements. Flint and brick extensions to rear, of 2 builds, with hipped tile roofs. Listing NGR: SP8422407272"
    }
  ],
